{"id":"4be9bd4d5b5cf4ed","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-internal-diagram.md","title":"df-internal-diagram","display":"df-internal-diagram","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"7.4","label":"16-df-internal-diagram","aliases":["16-df-internal-diagram","Internal diagram in a fibration"],"display":"df-internal-diagram","depends_on":["[[16-df-internal-category]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-substitution]]"],"source":"Definition 7.4.1 and Remark 7.4.2(i), pp. 431–432 (PDF 451–452)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7.4"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-internal-diagram"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-internal-diagram</span><span>Internal diagram in a fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-diagram"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 7.4.1 and Remark 7.4.2(i), pp. 431–432 (PDF 451–452)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m)\">\\(C=(C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 中的内部范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=d_0\">\\(s=d_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=d_1\">\\(t=d_1\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_2=C_1\\times_{s,C_0,t}C_1\">\\(C_2=C_1\\times_{s,C_0,t}C_1\\)</span>，投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(g,f)\">\\((g,f)\\)</span> 排列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(g,f)=g\\circ f\">\\(m(g,f)=g\\circ f\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 带指定 cleavage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 是其重索引，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>。不要求分裂。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal E_{C_0}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal E_{C_0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in\\mathcal E_{C_1}(s^*U,t^*U)\">\\(\\mu\\in\\mathcal E_{C_1}(s^*U,t^*U)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:T\\to S\">\\(a:T\\to S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:S\\to R\">\\(b:S\\to R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathcal E_R\">\\(V\\in\\mathcal E_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{a,b,V}\">\\(\\chi_{a,b,V}\\)</span> 是下列唯一描述式定义的垂直同构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde\\mu_a\">\\(\\widetilde\\mu_a\\)</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:T\\to C_1\">\\(a:T\\to C_1\\)</span> 定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota z[\\varphi(z)]\">\\(\\iota z[\\varphi(z)]\\)</span> 表示唯一满足所给条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；其存在唯一性由所用两条笛卡尔提升的泛性质给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_T\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}(X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}(X,Y)\\)</span> 的同构集合由 Assertion 内建定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntDiag}_{C}(p,\\kappa;U,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{IntDiag}_{C}(p,\\kappa;U,\\mu)\\)</span> 是下列公式引入的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{z\\in\\mathcal E_T(X,Y)\\mid\n(\\exists w\\in\\mathcal E_T(Y,X))\\\nwz=\\operatorname{id}_X\\land zw=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\},\\\\\n\\chi_{a,b,V}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\iota z\\in\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}\\bigl(a^*b^*V,(ba)^*V\\bigr)\\\n\\bigl[\\kappa(ba,V)\\circ z\n=\\kappa(b,V)\\circ\\kappa(a,b^*V)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\widetilde\\mu_a&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\chi_{a,t,U}\\circ a^*\\mu\\circ\\chi_{a,s,U}^{-1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntDiag}_{C}(p,\\kappa;U,\\mu)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\widetilde\\mu_e=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})^*U}\n\\land\\widetilde\\mu_m\n=\\widetilde\\mu_{\\pi_1}\\circ\\widetilde\\mu_{\\pi_2}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{z\\in\\mathcal E_T(X,Y)\\mid\n(\\exists w\\in\\mathcal E_T(Y,X))\\\nwz=\\operatorname{id}_X\\land zw=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\},\\\\\n\\chi_{a,b,V}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\iota z\\in\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}\\bigl(a^*b^*V,(ba)^*V\\bigr)\\\n\\bigl[\\kappa(ba,V)\\circ z\n=\\kappa(b,V)\\circ\\kappa(a,b^*V)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\widetilde\\mu_a&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\chi_{a,t,U}\\circ a^*\\mu\\circ\\chi_{a,s,U}^{-1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntDiag}_{C}(p,\\kappa;U,\\mu)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\widetilde\\mu_e=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})^*U}\n\\land\\widetilde\\mu_m\n=\\widetilde\\mu_{\\pi_1}\\circ\\widetilde\\mu_{\\pi_2}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde\\mu_a:(sa)^*U\\to(ta)^*U\">\\(\\widetilde\\mu_a:(sa)^*U\\to(ta)^*U\\)</span>，故两个等式分别位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{C_0}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{C_0}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{C_2}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{C_2}\\)</span>；内部范畴的源靶律给复合中间对象的严格相等。所需相干同构已经写在 Assertion，遮去本节仍能恢复非分裂情形的完整定义。</li>\n<li>若 cleavage 分裂，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 为恒等箭头，定义退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^*\\mu=\\operatorname{id}_U\">\\(e^*\\mu=\\operatorname{id}_U\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m^*\\mu=\\pi_1^*\\mu\\circ\\pi_2^*\\mu\">\\(m^*\\mu=\\pi_1^*\\mu\\circ\\pi_2^*\\mu\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 在本原子中显式保留，不能遗漏到一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntDiag}\">\\(\\mathrm{IntDiag}\\)</span> 记号中。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs，Definition 7.4.1 及 Remark 7.4.2(i)，印刷 pp. 431–432，PDF pp. 451–452。原书用交换图表达的 cleavage 相干识别在这里展开为规范比较箭头；本轮核对了单位、复合的类型和箭头次序。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C=(C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m)$ 是 $\\mathcal B$ 中的内部范畴，$s=d_0$、$t=d_1$，见 [[16-df-internal-category]]。$C_2=C_1\\times_{s,C_0,t}C_1$，投影 $\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 按 $(g,f)$ 排列，$m(g,f)=g\\circ f$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 带指定 cleavage $\\kappa$，见 [[16-df-cleavage]]；$u^*$ 是其重索引，见 [[16-df-substitution]]。不要求分裂。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 带指定 cleavage $\\kappa$，见 [[16-df-cleavage]]；$u^*$ 是其重索引，见 [[16-df-substitution]]。不要求分裂。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C=(C_0,C_1,s,t,e,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"s=d_0","display":false},{"tex":"t=d_1","display":false},{"tex":"C_2=C_1\\times_{s,C_0,t}C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"(g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"m(g,f)=g\\circ f","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal E_{C_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\in\\mathcal E_{C_1}(s^*U,t^*U)","display":false},{"tex":"a:T\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"b:S\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"V\\in\\mathcal E_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{a,b,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde\\mu_a","display":false},{"tex":"a:T\\to C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota z[\\varphi(z)]","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntDiag}_{C}(p,\\kappa;U,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}(X,Y)&\\coloneqq\n\\{z\\in\\mathcal E_T(X,Y)\\mid\n(\\exists w\\in\\mathcal E_T(Y,X))\\\nwz=\\operatorname{id}_X\\land zw=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\},\\\\\n\\chi_{a,b,V}&\\coloneqq\n\\iota z\\in\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\mathcal E_T}\\bigl(a^*b^*V,(ba)^*V\\bigr)\\\n\\bigl[\\kappa(ba,V)\\circ z\n=\\kappa(b,V)\\circ\\kappa(a,b^*V)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\widetilde\\mu_a&\\coloneqq\n\\chi_{a,t,U}\\circ a^*\\mu\\circ\\chi_{a,s,U}^{-1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntDiag}_{C}(p,\\kappa;U,\\mu)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\widetilde\\mu_e=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})^*U}\n\\land\\widetilde\\mu_m\n=\\widetilde\\mu_{\\pi_1}\\circ\\widetilde\\mu_{\\pi_2}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\widetilde\\mu_a:(sa)^*U\\to(ta)^*U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{C_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{C_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"e^*\\mu=\\operatorname{id}_U","display":false},{"tex":"m^*\\mu=\\pi_1^*\\mu\\circ\\pi_2^*\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntDiag}","display":false}],"bytes":2812,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-category]]、[[16-df-externalization]]、[[16-df-internal-diagram]]、[[16-df-locally-small-fibration]]、[[16-df-small-fibration]]、[[16-thm-full-internal-category]]、[[16-thm-internalization]]、[[16-thm-presheaf-internalization]]、[[16-thm-extern-preserves]]。相对于原基范畴的小性与改变基底后的预层内部化分别阅读。"}],"outgoing":["75d304b3477bee01","4ea27d39c2af987b","ccfbb871fa39931c"]}